  "description": "A .NET library for joystick and game controller input via DirectInput. Provides three abstraction levels: Joystick (raw IObservable<JoystickUpdate> stream), ColdJoystick (snapshot IObservable with full state replay), and GroupedJoystick (typed observable channels for axes, buttons, sliders, and POV). Built on Vortice.DirectInput and System.Reactive.",
